    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">An automated skyscraper elevator moves sequentially through a list of passenger floor requests.<br><br>Given the initial floor <var>startFloor</var> and a sequence of <var>N</var> destination floors, calculate the <strong>total distance</strong> traveled in floors.<br><br>The elevator travels directly between each consecutive stop without resetting to the ground floor.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: An integer <var>startFloor</var> representing the elevator's initial floor.<br><strong>Line 2</strong>: An integer <var>N</var> representing the number of stops.<br><strong>Next <var>N</var> lines</strong>: An integer <var>floor</var> representing each requested destination floor in visit order.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>A single line</strong>: An integer representing the total number of floors traveled.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>-10</const> &le; <var>startFloor</var>, <var>floor</var> &le; <const>100</const><br><const>1</const> &le; <var>N</var> &le; <const>10</const></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">0\n3\n5\n2\n8</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">14</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
